<%# A top-N panel, rendered by the same partial as the default dashboard's
    panels so suppression messaging cannot drift. Locals: site, report, result
    (data: Analytics::Breakdown::Result).

    drillable: false everywhere on custom dashboards, not just the public
    copies: a widget's filters are fixed by its author, there is no viewer
    filter state to merge a drill-down into — and it is also what makes the
    public path trivially safe. -%>
<%= render "sites/breakdown",
           site: site,
           panel: { dimension: result.widget.dimension,
                    title: result.widget.display_title,
                    result: result.data },
           drillable: false %>
